/*
  Assembly:   motion-stack-608
  Instances:  4
  Description: Shaft with two simplified bearings and a spacer. Bearing rolling elements are cylindrical proxies.
    shaft = Shaft 8 x 40 ()
    bearing-a = Bearing 608 (ISO 15 boundary dimensions; simplified internal geometry)
    bearing-b = Bearing 608 (ISO 15 boundary dimensions; simplified internal geometry)
    spacer = Spacer OD 12 / ID 8 x 10 ()
  Features modeled:      body, outer-ring, inner-ring, ball-sphere
  Features approximated: outer-ring-boundary (PolylineArc, deviation 0.02355184437536173 mm, control circle_segments=48); inner-ring-bore (PolylineArc, deviation 0.008564307045586084 mm, control circle_segments=48); through-bore (PolylineArc, deviation 0.00722726276896557 mm, control circle_segments=64)
  Features omitted:      keyway (not modelled; represent it with an evaluated cut); shaft-chamfer (not modelled by this builder); shoulder-fillet (a plain shaft has no shoulder); seal (seals are not modelled in this envelope); cage (rolling-element cages are not modelled); race-groove (rolling-element race grooves are not modelled); bore-chamfer (the bore and outer edges are not chamfered at Simplified detail); ring-edge-chamfer (omitted at Simplified detail level); edge-chamfer (not modelled by this builder)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Shaft with two simplified bearings and a spacer. Bearing rolling elements are cylindrical proxies.'),'2;1');
